{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_84e7f777387f4e07b68325bf069db430","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_275afd71d4edbac7a58a0f8db6ee62a59e87e9edaa35886b5a494b8d488be213","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"mattolson/agent-sandbox@5df0b4bc6c57 snapshot 4c77988393ee6d90","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_79d936ba79f8d289b376514093f5bbbbd6bfa92dcbf91cd78b3767e67ce655d3"],"source_ids":["src_70d31b454b965255840004743f40f7d3"],"text":"The proxy runs a mitmproxy addon (enforcer.py) that checks HTTPS CONNECT tunnels against the host policy and decrypted requests against scheme, method, path, and query rules, returning 403 for non-matching traffic.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_84e7f777387f4e07b68325bf069db430"}
