{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_84e7f777387f4e07b68325bf069db430","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_627a2a8ef85d6de427eeba0cb35bf6e2164fc753a18c3b43b02b00e481c57cc3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"mattolson/agent-sandbox@5df0b4bc6c57 snapshot 4c77988393ee6d90","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_03ed34a2e7852eb7393e9f27349e19eab632c854797d6d4312cf265a4539a5d8","slc_5ef6a941a24e55bcc011ac6ee2b48334ab59100520353ee0ab9e2209ee5ac612","slc_a0477e322d6bd7b31683a673890e126b925aa96f739db17cbbb57ee04f514878","slc_ef337e62950e33564d90d8d9b91ac966da958aba66988a75a67daa8b7a71f794"],"source_ids":["src_75b12db71e5a50f982b3a4a5aceb354c"],"text":"SSH port 22 is blocked to prevent proxy-bypassing tunnels, and the container's system git config rewrites SSH GitHub URLs to HTTPS; the image ships Git 2.50.1 with worktree.useRelativePaths=true.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_84e7f777387f4e07b68325bf069db430"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_84e7f777387f4e07b68325bf069db430","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6464aeebe592d2382ed05c095ac5e8ff004b3e95e015fd0b432f6ca70cd27b94","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"mattolson/agent-sandbox@5df0b4bc6c57 snapshot 4c77988393ee6d90","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_54f68f06b2e52f43fd10469c85348e8d2ea35873c8e7e5873985a772d7cb56c5","slc_79137b9b383fc2de18bbe09cf6c0d03cce56016d99235549da2a27f273984c87"],"source_ids":["src_70d31b454b965255840004743f40f7d3"],"text":"The project states it reduces but does not eliminate risk, describing local dev as inherently best-effort sandboxing; the network policy does not inspect request bodies or response content, so a broad token could reach any repo allowed through a permitted GitHub endpoint.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_84e7f777387f4e07b68325bf069db430"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_84e7f777387f4e07b68325bf069db430","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6890487d638c6d5bb3fa7a2d580b989dad1fc18be1fd852c0bb318b7fbdfac34","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"mattolson/agent-sandbox@5df0b4bc6c57 snapshot 4c77988393ee6d90","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_13154b4b1e2455278486d22fe9c690acac1a7450ac23f72215bee8b0c1bc16dd","slc_95277c9ef20fd161ca3b412d399cfc4832baeb690e956568d3ed86db094abf88","slc_ba467f04fdcb5a1db645cfd6d6bd031a9449ed55e0deb81f8076250d3a1dc2d5"],"source_ids":["src_0b31519402275c90b2650b68ac73ff78","src_70d31b454b965255840004743f40f7d3"],"text":"agentbox switch changes the active agent without reinitializing, preserving user override files and per-agent state volumes, and regenerating devcontainer.json in devcontainer projects.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_84e7f777387f4e07b68325bf069db430"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_84e7f777387f4e07b68325bf069db430","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_71dfa3a3b7574daff7d7838f6c3dae07e1bc84195fa03c308d286d33c7eac1aa","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"mattolson/agent-sandbox@5df0b4bc6c57 snapshot 4c77988393ee6d90","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4fc4d48eaf6ab7b6669cd0051ef6a9f0240e644f2d158a07f4c5281f7549888e","slc_df8b65ef9c7b674ca531f71dff8e76a460d6684cd73deb5fd3e63f2b5a096b9e"],"source_ids":["src_70d31b454b965255840004743f40f7d3"],"text":"The default proxy policy blocks all traffic; public package registries such as PyPI are intentionally not allowed by default and must be added explicitly to user or per-agent policy.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_84e7f777387f4e07b68325bf069db430"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_84e7f777387f4e07b68325bf069db430","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8511be75f2532b77aeb4a306747a393e8c96f20eb0149bc7c8a6c5e153269acd","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"mattolson/agent-sandbox@5df0b4bc6c57 snapshot 4c77988393ee6d90","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_37008ad183d706046063229457235724a6685254748bf167eada01902911f5ff","slc_aae64a8166469e7dfd8799bcc7895fbc051fba92f196405190bcd721b0769096","slc_f157932ac91fe863ba9708f9d020416170a9bfa7fcc569d966ba491cbf886363"],"source_ids":["src_70d31b454b965255840004743f40f7d3"],"text":"In devcontainer mode, IDE-managed features such as port forwarding, browser URL opening, and extension RPC form a separate control plane not fully removed by the container firewall; CLI mode is suggested for the tightest boundary.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_84e7f777387f4e07b68325bf069db430"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_84e7f777387f4e07b68325bf069db430","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c60ce4e1fd1cad55f196bac441f567a0c61aeeff3511e228a7d61951bb86d5cd","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"mattolson/agent-sandbox@5df0b4bc6c57 snapshot 4c77988393ee6d90","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5b04f565032f459d0e875be3732a26093bc7ce62c8d4a928b311acbfd773d316"],"source_ids":["src_70d31b454b965255840004743f40f7d3"],"text":"The base image includes the GitHub CLI so agents can use gh api for issues and pull requests with a repo-scoped api policy surface while the token stays on the host.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_84e7f777387f4e07b68325bf069db430"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_84e7f777387f4e07b68325bf069db430","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d076ad5c93a84003623be28363429be0283c0480673f0f4e5fd908b7e702a17e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"mattolson/agent-sandbox@5df0b4bc6c57 snapshot 4c77988393ee6d90","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2b7467d307ed7fec99691f567afa0f8716e13c30f6f6aff1a2c448ee7c5b57b1"],"source_ids":["src_70d31b454b965255840004743f40f7d3"],"text":"The proxy's CA certificate is shared via a Docker volume and installed into the agent's system trust store at startup so HTTPS inspection works.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_84e7f777387f4e07b68325bf069db430"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_84e7f777387f4e07b68325bf069db430","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_dc6b4d88debb9250845763365579b3136a18589a90db8362c81c0fa6b1abbe78","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"mattolson/agent-sandbox@5df0b4bc6c57 snapshot 4c77988393ee6d90","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_016b33ff6cbb9cde0ba868b2d61e65bd789b8213415fab081d9082afaf075a1b","slc_b5042198e91afa4186b5e81dcbc5a6357f8507a674ff61e68b8e2fb7da74f340"],"source_ids":["src_70d31b454b965255840004743f40f7d3"],"text":"The sandbox restricts filesystem access to the repository directory, enforces egress via a sidecar proxy, and uses an iptables firewall so all outbound traffic must pass through the proxy.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_84e7f777387f4e07b68325bf069db430"}
